  def tab "Widgets"
    icon 🧩
    def heading "Live widgets"
    def paragraph "Widgets are interactive blocks whose data is readable text: one item per line, fields separated by |. Edit them visually in VS Code or as text; both stay in sync."
    def tab "Planning"
      def kanban "Launch board"
        board """[Todo]
Pricing page copy
Status page alerts
[In progress]
Offline sync
[Done]
Load test at 5x traffic"""
      def timeline "Roadmap"
        events """2026-10-27 | Tabs and sites | done | jotx 3.2
2026-12-01 | Public launch | planned | Website and docs
2027-02-01 | Team spaces | planned"""
      def decision "Use CRDTs for sync"
        status accepted
        date 2026-08-04
        context Last-write-wins lost edits when two people changed the same note.
        decision Merge changes with CRDTs.
        consequences Larger payloads, and no lost edits.
      def matrix "This week"
        dofirst Fix data loss bug
        schedule Write the launch post
        delegate Reply to partners
        eliminate Tidy old notes
      def proscons "Adopt SQLite?"
        pros """Zero operations
Fast for one user"""
        cons """Migration effort
No shared writes"""
      def steps "Release checklist"
        steps """[x] Build and test | npm run build && npm test
[x] Package | vsce package
[ ] Publish | npm and the Marketplace"""
